 event. However, it’s important to note that multiple partial updates can be queued","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"for the same GeoJSON source when ongoing source parsing is taking place. In these cases, the partial"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"updates will be applied to the source in batches. Only the data ID provided in the most recent call within","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each batch will be included in the "},{"code":"source-data-loaded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" event. If no data ID is provided in the most recent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"call, the data ID in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source-data-loaded"},{"text":"event will be null.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleError"},{"text":" if there is a problem adding features to the source.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10MapboxMaps12StyleManagerC24addGeoJSONSourceFeatures11forSourceId8features04dataK0ySS_Say4Turf7FeatureVGSSSgtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addGeoJSONSourceFeatures"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"forSourceId"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"features","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps7Featurea","text":"Feature"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dataId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"te